and friends laugh.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.245
It was called the helium voice.

00:00:24.245 --> 00:00:25.078
- [Kelly] Okay.
- And when I-

00:00:25.078 --> 00:00:26.300
- I used to love to do
that when I was a kid

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.150
with the balloons.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.570
- Yeah. It's like that.
- Yeah.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.527
- And I would break into
the chorus, you know,

00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:33.990
"we all live in the yellow
submarine" in the helium voice.

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.545
- So you, what is that sound?

00:00:35.545 --> 00:00:36.378
Like a Munchkin from Oz?
- Well, I gotta let me see

00:00:36.378 --> 00:00:38.779
if I can get, let me see if
I can get my helium back on.

00:00:38.779 --> 00:00:39.612
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:39.612 --> 00:00:41.278
(audience laughing)
You can just do it?

00:00:41.278 --> 00:00:45.207
♪ We all live in the yellow submarine ♪

00:00:45.207 --> 00:00:48.643
♪ The yellow submarine,
the yellow submarine ♪

00:00:48.643 --> 00:00:49.476
(audience cheering)

00:00:49.476 --> 00:00:51.233
- And everybody, it still works.

00:00:52.077 --> 00:00:54.181
It still works. Yes.

00:00:54.181 --> 00:00:55.734
